{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a limited portion of the full Shadowland experience. In this version:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play as 1 of the 3 planned main characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to 3 weapons from the total 35 weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 allied unit types are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 regular enemy types and 1 second-tier enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small portion of the full game map is included for testing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited access to the market and equipment system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No boss fights, story progression, additional characters, or full mercenary system are included in this demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will feature all characters, complete storyline, full map, bosses, and expanded systems.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819060?t=1751300662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819060?t=1751300662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819060/41cfee201c3f8a7e666f1e7bb9f49fe64f10aa19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751300662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819060/41cfee201c3f8a7e666f1e7bb9f49fe64f10aa19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751300662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains fantasy combat with mild violence. There is no nudity or sexual content. Some enemies are monstrous creatures or dark magic users, but the content is suitable for general audiences. There are no depictions of sexual violence, drug use, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a limited portion of the full Shadowland experience. In this version:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play as 1 of the 3 planned main characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to 3 weapons from the total 35 weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 allied unit types are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 regular enemy types and 1 second-tier enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small portion of the full game map is included for testing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited access to the market and equipment system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No boss fights, story progression, additional characters, or full mercenary system are included in this demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will feature all characters, complete storyline, full map, bosses, and expanded systems.</p>","developers":["Talon Software"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3777400","name":"Shadowland: Rise Of The Fallen"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819060/46b710f6986eee6069e0a58a7aceb6a267e463b6/header.jpg?t=1751300662","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257162914,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162914/movie480.mp4?t=1751300651","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162914/movie_max.mp4?t=1751300651"},"name":"War Beast","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162914/1a1ec0702a1a05c058c0967a18f92636aef1df55/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751300651","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162914/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751300651","max":"http://v